## Hub Système @GEST_VERSION@

**Flatpak uniquement** — dépôt public : [Gest_Linux_Pro](https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/Hub-Systeme/releases/tag/v@GEST_VERSION@)

```bash
cd ~
wget -O org.mraurevox.HubSysteme.flatpak \
  https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/Hub-Systeme/releases/download/v@GEST_VERSION@/org.mraurevox.HubSysteme.flatpak
flatpak install --user -y ./org.mraurevox.HubSysteme.flatpak
wget -O INSTALLER-RACCOURCI-FLATPAK.sh \
  https://github.com/Mr-Aurevo-X/Hub-Systeme/releases/download/v@GEST_VERSION@/INSTALLER-RACCOURCI-FLATPAK.sh
bash ./INSTALLER-RACCOURCI-FLATPAK.sh
flatpak run org.mraurevox.HubSysteme
```

Retirer une ancienne native CachyOS : `bash ~/.local/share/hub-systeme/uninstall.sh`

